{"anomaly_threshold":75,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：检测防火墙拒绝次数激增。对应需求：网络异常。官方：Spike in Firewall Denies。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"from":"now-30m","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["high_count_network_denies"],"name":"【默认】防火墙拒绝次数激增（机器学习）","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 主机或边界启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **Network Packet Capture**，保证网络/DNS/HTTP 数据入湖。\n2. 关联的机器学习 job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"eaa77d63-9679-4ce3-be25-3ba8b795e5fa","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 网络异常","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: 网络异常"],"type":"machine_learning","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n防火墙拒绝次数激增\n\n### 为何重要\n相对网络流量基线出现罕见域名、国家或流量尖峰\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、时间窗与是否处于 ML 基线学习期。\n2. 核对关联主机、用户、进程或网络目的是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同实体前后同类告警与落地文件/外连。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线\n- 机器学习基线尚未稳定\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机或账号，并排查持久化与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1041","name":"Exfiltration Over C2 Channel","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1041/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1018","name":"Remote System Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/"},{"id":"T1046","name":"Network Service Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1590","name":"Gather Victim Network Information","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1590/"},{"id":"T1595","name":"Active Scanning","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1595/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0043","name":"Reconnaissance","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0043/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1498","name":"Network Denial of Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1498/"},{"id":"T1499","name":"Endpoint Denial of Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1499/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.domain","dns.question.name","url.original","user_agent.original","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"version":111,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
